cql3dNCVariables is the output of ncdump -c cql3d.nc
cql3dRF_NCVariables is the output of ncdump -c cql3d_krf001.nc
GenrayNCVariables is the output of ncdump -c genray.nc
eqdsk_variables lists of the dictionary variables generated by getGfileDict.py and OMFIT_EQDSK
geqdskCode.py is a copy of the source code for OMFIT_EQDSK